        },
        {
          "title": "RUlE 2 / dEFinitions FR-37",
          "content": "c\b Loss of player possession by unsuccessful execution of attempted handing\nis a fumble by the last player in possession [Exception: The snap (Rule\n2-23-1-c)]\b\nd\b A backward handoff occurs when the ball carrier releases the ball before it\nis beyond the yard line where the ball carrier is positioned\b",
          "start_page": 40,
