          "snippet": ""
        },
        {
          "title": "ARTICLE 1\b a\b Hurdling is an attempt by a player to jump with one or both",
          "content": "feet or knees foremost over an opponent while that opponent is still on their\nfeet (Rule 9-1-13)\b\nb\b “On their feet’’ means that no part of the opponent’s body other than one\nor both feet is in contact with the ground\b",
