        {
          "title": "ARTICLE 5\b a\b A free kick is a kick by a player of the team in possession made",
          "content": "under restrictions specified in Rules 4-1-4, 6-1-1 and 6-1-2\b\nb\b A free kick after a safety may be a punt, drop kick or place kick\b\nKickoff",
