          "id": "mens_football-rule-169",
          "snippet": "beyond the neutral zone to an eligible player who has a reasonable opportunity to catch the ball\b When in question, a legal forward pass is catchable\b"
        },
        {
          "title": "SECTION 20. PENALTY",
          "content": "A penalty is a result imposed by rule against a team that has committed a foul\nand may include one or more of the following: loss of yardage, loss of down,\nautomatic first down, disqualification, ejection, subtraction from the game\nclock (Rule 10-1-1-b)\b",
          "start_page": 43,
          "id": "mens_football-rule-170",
          "snippet": "A penalty is a result imposed by rule against a team that has committed a foul and may include one or more of the following: loss of yardage, loss of down, automatic first down, disqualification, ejec…"
        },
        {
          "title": "SECTION 21. SCRIMMAGE",
          "content": "Scrimmage Down",
          "start_page": 43,
