          "title": "ARTICLE 1\b Instant replay personnel shall consist of the number of persons",
          "content": "needed to operate the replay equipment within the necessary time constraints\b\nThere shall be a minimum of three persons to ensure that all plays are reviewed\nin an efficient and timely manner\b Such persons are normally referred to as\nreplay official, communicator and technician\b Additional personnel may be\nused as needed\b\nEquipment",
          "start_page": 124,
