          "snippet": "When To Stop a Game"
        },
        {
          "title": "ARTICLE 2\b a\b A game may be stopped, either by the replay official or by a",
          "content": "head coach’s challenge, at any time before the ball is next legally put in play\n(Exception: Rule 3-2-1-c and Rule 12-3-6-f)\b\nb\b No game official may request that a game be stopped for a play to be\nreviewed\b",
          "start_page": 126,
          "id": "mens_football-rule-515",
          "snippet": "head coach’s challenge, at any time before the ball is next legally put in play (Exception: Rule 3-2-1-c and Rule 12-3-6-f)\b b\b No game official may request that a game be stopped for a play to be rev…"
