          "title": "Appendix B",
          "content": "Lightning Policy\nThe NCAA provides detailed guidance on lightning (and other\nenvironmental hazards) in the NCAA Sports Medicine Handbook\b\nPlease consult the latest version of this handbook, which is available at\nwww.ncaa.org\b\nFR-126\n\n[PAGE 130]",
