          "title": "Points of Emphasis",
          "content": "In each edition of the NCAA Women's Basketball Rules Book, several areas\nare given special attention. These are identified as points of emphasis. While\nthey may not represent any rules changes, their importance must not be\noverlooked. In some cases, the points of emphasis are more critical than\nsome of the rules changes. For example, when a topic is included in the",
